      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "PODCAST PRODUCTION ENGINE -- Skill 58\nWhat: End-to-end draft-verification pipeline: authenticates with Podbean, downloads audio from a URL, uploads it to Podbean, creates a DRAFT episode, verifies the draft is published, then DELETES it. This is a SAFETY TEST -- it proves the full Podbean upload+create pipeline works before trusting it with a real publish.\nTrigger: POST /webhook/podcast-draft-test (header-authenticated)\nOutput: JSON confirming draft episode was created, verified (status=draft), and deleted (deleted=true), all without appearing on the live feed\nCredentials: Podcast Publish Gate (header auth), Podbean BlackCEO (client_credentials OAuth)\nFlow: Guard -> Standing Gate (roster lookup) -> Podbean OAuth Token -> Download Audio -> uploadAuthorize -> PUT Audio -> Create Draft Episode -> Fetch Draft Verify -> Podbean OAuth Delete Token -> DELETE Draft -> Respond"
      },
